  "status": "pending_collection",
  "purpose": "Index completed Result evidence reused from already verified archives. Pending rows or uncovered declared result families are release blockers. Every evidence entry is independently hash-bound and receipt-bound to its canonical result.",
  "schema_change": "v3 is intentionally incompatible with earlier drafts: each method owns evidence[] and evidence bytes live in one SHA-256-bound, release-attachable ZIP rather than ignored local result directories.",
